title: mf sync link
tags: [[CLI command]] Sync
kind: reference
summary: Link a record of one repository to a record of the other, by hand.

For what the plan cannot decide — an ambiguous match, an incoherence that stopped
it ([[Matching records across repositories]]). The first record belongs to the first
repository named. Prints the link's uuid. `--host` places the pair's sync database
when this link creates it.
